        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Dream is a free experimental game I made while exploring visual storytelling, a direction I have since continued in other projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a series of surreal dreams where nothing behaves as expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person horror game blends an unsettling atmosphere with puzzle-like challenges, creating moments of confusion, tension, and discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> - Fear, desperation, and hopelessness born in the mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Dreams</strong> - The Betrayal, The Old Soul, Against the Wind, and Help Me. Each follows its own unsettling rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Logic</strong> - Strange puzzles invite experimentation, not conventional solutions. Follow dreamlike associations to find your way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric &amp; Surreal</strong> - Minimal UI, no dialogue, just raw immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Saving</strong> - Your progress is saved - return later and continue the dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, adapt, and escape the dreams - if you can.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Dream is a free experimental game I made while exploring visual storytelling, a direction I have since continued in other projects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a series of surreal dreams where nothing behaves as expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This first-person horror game blends an unsettling atmosphere with puzzle-like challenges, creating moments of confusion, tension, and discovery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong> - Fear, desperation, and hopelessness born in the mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four Dreams</strong> - The Betrayal, The Old Soul, Against the Wind, and Help Me. Each follows its own unsettling rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dream Logic</strong> - Strange puzzles invite experimentation, not conventional solutions. Follow dreamlike associations to find your way out.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric &amp; Surreal</strong> - Minimal UI, no dialogue, just raw immersion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress Saving</strong> - Your progress is saved - return later and continue the dream.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, adapt, and escape the dreams - if you can.</p>",
